{"3464280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space-Time Girl", "steam_appid": 3464280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, every choice will rewrite the trajectory of time and space, and every girl will become your most reliable ally. Whether it's nurturing your favorite characters or strategizing in the arena, this game fulfills all your fantasies about 2D RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎴 Rich Character Development System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive Girl Collection: Featuring dozens of unique 2D anime girls, each with their own story, skill tree, and development path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Development System: Obtain characters and development materials through gacha pulls, dungeon drops, and events. Unlock skills, equipment, and costumes to build your exclusive combat team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Diverse Battle Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE Dungeon Challenges: From normal story dungeons to elite levels, from limited-time events to extreme challenges, the diverse dungeon designs test your team composition and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Team Composition: Freely combine different characters' skills and synergy effects to create ever-changing combat styles. There's no single strongest strategy, only the one that suits you best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Social and Guild Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create Your Own Guild: Create or join a guild with friends, share resources, challenge team dungeons, and participate in guild leagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Cooperative Missions: Team up to conquer challenging dungeons, share loot and achievements, and make more friends on your adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-Tier Artwork: All characters feature high-quality illustrations, and the scenes and effects are full of anime fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous Content Updates: Regularly released new characters, new dungeons, and limited-time events keep the game fresh and playable.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, every choice will rewrite the trajectory of time and space, and every girl will become your most reliable ally. Whether it's nurturing your favorite characters or strategizing in the arena, this game fulfills all your fantasies about 2D RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎴 Rich Character Development System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive Girl Collection: Featuring dozens of unique 2D anime girls, each with their own story, skill tree, and development path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Development System: Obtain characters and development materials through gacha pulls, dungeon drops, and events. Unlock skills, equipment, and costumes to build your exclusive combat team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Diverse Battle Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE Dungeon Challenges: From normal story dungeons to elite levels, from limited-time events to extreme challenges, the diverse dungeon designs test your team composition and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Team Composition: Freely combine different characters' skills and synergy effects to create ever-changing combat styles. There's no single strongest strategy, only the one that suits you best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Social and Guild Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create Your Own Guild: Create or join a guild with friends, share resources, challenge team dungeons, and participate in guild leagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Cooperative Missions: Team up to conquer challenging dungeons, share loot and achievements, and make more friends on your adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-Tier Artwork: All characters feature high-quality illustrations, and the scenes and effects are full of anime fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous Content Updates: Regularly released new characters, new dungeons, and limited-time events keep the game fresh and playable.</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Space-Time Girl&quot; is a new RPG that focuses on raising and strategically battling 2D anime girls, taking you into a fantastical world interwoven with multiple timelines.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464280/6240c21e869482514f5fa2a0e79b8d195983625a/header.jpg?t=1779328759", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464280/c2d48141b7b8a828f872ff37dacd7e6de59a81dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779328759", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464280/c2d48141b7b8a828f872ff37dacd7e6de59a81dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779328759", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> win7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core-i3 or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated/independent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> soundblaster</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> win7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core-i3 or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated/independent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> soundblaster</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": []